  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:119ce381f78b62238781cd53cea1fce87976ca0e7b9520a33c4cdea0ae4c054f",
      "request_id": "119ce381f78b62238781cd53cea1fce87976ca0e7b9520a33c4cdea0ae4c054f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a36a1d64b6ed08d6931e1012be823adf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月二十五号，她刚在成都赢下十八岁及以下组的年终总决赛。第二天赶到广州，落地后就去适应场地。冠军来不及细细回味，新的考验已经到了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d12ad54a281a4ac3bbbad66518b4d02130c23ab4cf84cffbfc465690c3bd2d9d",
      "words_sha256": "9a0e320ef81b4b0b3bc0bb0e23c1ba9a961c44356ed2d658fa55eb4c9c479f86"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2745bc1d31565742912cf81aa5d90a9a9f6e553aa5508422dfb5a693cbcf5738",
      "request_id": "2745bc1d31565742912cf81aa5d90a9a9f6e553aa5508422dfb5a693cbcf5738",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "508c93a3bb41a97df595667c08a385ac",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘二比二，她继续把球打深，压住对手的底线。正反拍来回顶住之后，机会又落到她这一边。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0de175b721590c8767cf3a69141b60d9179645c2c485f4f037ca2a8619b6c6f7",
      "words_sha256": "1edbccc4955b6ba8f40fe8a95646cd4a8b9ae17fa6a22a5e35a40fa50be0bcbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:67dd2720a77fac5fcf58979e4dc6fcdead5983eb64338f57d4763cf31feeac59",
      "request_id": "67dd2720a77fac5fcf58979e4dc6fcdead5983eb64338f57d4763cf31feeac59",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6b7c1a8e11dc4bc9cf0e7a7720a42d13",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "成都夺冠，是一个新的起点。把这一场胜利收好，再迎接下一场挑战。十六岁的她，还会带来什么惊喜？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cd71899a0e33a00b3ffcb28df096a472cb45aad44c82a87e464393a917436ce5",
      "words_sha256": "fcc4ae960b296eacf535394f76d8519365d842860913b84e47c5704766be87cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a8e38d75260ea886190add6bb4c7da2f2066c090dd6dce911a4307aabe3db7fd",
      "request_id": "a8e38d75260ea886190add6bb4c7da2f2066c090dd6dce911a4307aabe3db7fd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e5e503f3c7187e7667096db40baaf978",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十月二十七号晚上，广州首轮。十六岁的孙心然，六比三、六比四击败萨王凯，晋级十六强。两天前，她还在成都捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3dbcb146f26dd15049270240a4a8a8548be747b5a1226a47e160266af63a967d",
      "words_sha256": "c8aa7d06c435bbece37a655ba3b2c81959f80285036931539fb21f328d1717dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3d7277d26afc569ab1979d3485891d79e290c7f020c7ffccb0a9e1a2d11c811f",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bd92766d30163f753f5122dcc737385c2a3e06c10b182f0eb6cd098a85b8c485",
      "request_id": "bd92766d30163f753f5122dcc737385c2a3e06c10b182f0eb6cd098a85b8c485",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5cefe9644bc04e62ef610e63624a44f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她低头走向网前，把掌声留在身后。两天前的冠军，没有让脚步停下来。今晚，她又走稳了一步。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "89564ff60a89f095feac999c74a82078c3c1d0c5a91b7bfc7300b3ff56cc99a8",
      "words_sha256": "aead69ce42ba8d1243278bf453b8c13fefc6b5b2610b0fffe732ad473501e379"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d38962ccc8f3ca70a3643268207b7e0155ecaa0030d824360c0c04be75948fa3",
      "request_id": "d38962ccc8f3ca70a3643268207b7e0155ecaa0030d824360c0c04be75948fa3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c2a65bc3891525e87db8bfc3c33e0d76",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但四比二，不是安全线。对手把她拉向边线，再突然放短；领先之后，仍要一分一分地守。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "96dfd36549889efb5ddcfc936bdd4ae137707596eba7ec8ac463850ef4b40383",
      "words_sha256": "b08c87172703341c8e031bd39bcfafcc5868648d3d7516177ab96c743f783117"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d3bc5daa6d31c2341a82f76f87c40a77d001892e305522dd0d299173c37addc4",
      "request_id": "d3bc5daa6d31c2341a82f76f87c40a77d001892e305522dd0d299173c37addc4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ed478ddb7f9feb1f8e76c27724c79b1f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三比二领先，这一次她把反拍顶得很深，再沿着斜线寻找角度。萨王凯不断把球挡回来，孙心然也没有急着一拍结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "75720818581818918fae443f6348c5a4fcb8ccd0b7e510170155c81b00c61ba7",
      "words_sha256": "706023810d618067c4f3d3c26a7a0a1cdeaafa6e218e4f3a379c72e5a13f7e64"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dffad748aa3e7c077fa6165daf5e3d8d21334b93a51bf5b37d43b80f8ba77c46",
      "request_id": "dffad748aa3e7c077fa6165daf5e3d8d21334b93a51bf5b37d43b80f8ba77c46",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "59bc7e4ee8dfd8f7e7df3659fa1a6f26",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "在国际网联十八岁及以下组，她已是女子世界第一。可职业赛场上，对面是世界第八十。赢下一盘，不等于已经赢下整场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "716ce852700b87cc054bbd91ee2762559fca24eb1aa5ce937c8a2a6017fde70b",
      "words_sha256": "fb8a3d735f1132410bd41188270e580fb908c103e442029f2950c351588d80ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e2b5d7eea80ec51ea0cb6d3ca175ccf6debc7bc95ad6568aef84f8647f270e18",
      "request_id": "e2b5d7eea80ec51ea0cb6d3ca175ccf6debc7bc95ad6568aef84f8647f270e18",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6dc1f8fc40403d86cfec66b84153631c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "制胜分九比十七，非受迫性失误二十一比四十一。她不是打得更猛，而是少送机会，把优势守到了最后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "decb48e6acf1ecbc79b41a5c9afb65811d4627c8d304f4e7c857e088ee5340fb",
      "words_sha256": "0c4ebbcb7e29240306b6afa0c3f226a22fcc101f2438a11f2d136d632fc0a4d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f1b276166302ec1acaa43bc30974cb7f8dbd77b49c1e9fbd8ee65ff400ca6531",
      "request_id": "f1b276166302ec1acaa43bc30974cb7f8dbd77b49c1e9fbd8ee65ff400ca6531",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "63271d14464689c4dd1ef01655f0bb88",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "领先来到四比三，离胜利越来越近。可对手没有放弃，这个发球局，又被拖进漫长的拉锯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "98a98280042be191133f800bbf7e28cbe948d3a3f7db1c6775805d5bc0a08383",
      "words_sha256": "ced678d0351a5fdb4a758ea91cf79cef5f31d89eae0822a3a87349d012f84bff"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fcbf8265c02461883bc2780b59b12b19b6597d9fa2f141b7426f04f6a3816ba3",
      "request_id": "fcbf8265c02461883bc2780b59b12b19b6597d9fa2f141b7426f04f6a3816ba3",
